      "confidence": "high",
      "rationale": "The only flexor of the distal interphalangeal joints, and the prime mover of finger flexion in gripping, so it is the prime grip muscle. It crosses the wrist and assists wrist flexion.",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
