      "confidence": "high",
      "rationale": "The prime thumb flexor, and the only flexor of the thumb interphalangeal joint; it wraps the thumb around a bar or handle, a clear grip contribution behind the finger flexors. It gives minor assistance to wrist flexion.",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
