      "confidence": "medium",
      "rationale": "The main belly of extensor carpi ulnaris. Its insertion on the fifth metacarpal gives a large ulnar deviation moment and a moderate extension moment. The extension moment falls in pronation, which is position-dependent. It stabilizes the ulnar side of the wrist when a load is held.",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    {
