      "confidence": "high",
      "rationale": "A small and often absent muscle that weakly flexes the wrist and tenses the palmar aponeurosis, giving a minor share of wrist stabilization. Tensing the aponeurosis is not a vocabulary action.",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
